    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d314">

                <pb facs="0417" n="245" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg245"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/3692</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Panama</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Price</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-04-06T21:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 6, 1917, 9 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received April 7, 5.15 a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Pursuant to my suggestions Panaman President is sending a message to President
                        Wilson to-night, and to-morrow the
                    exequaturs of all German consuls in Panama will be canceled, (there being no
                    diplomatic representative), and an appropriate proclamation will be issued.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Price</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
